# Channel messages show "heard N repeats" as repeaters rebroadcast them; ping
# reaches a companion that shares telemetry, via path discovery.
# both-modes
repeater Hilltop 9
repeater Ridge 7
link Hilltop Ridge 6
node Jo 8 telem
as Hilltop advert
as Ridge advert
as Jo advert
wait 3000
# Post to Public (Channels tab): both repeaters rebroadcast it.
key left
key enter
type Testing repeats
key enter
wait 4000
expect repeats 2
shot chan-heard-repeats
hold esc 900
# Advertise ourselves so Jo can answer, then ping Jo.
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
hold esc 900
key right
type jo
key enter
key tab
# Message, Details, Favourite, (Reset path is disabled: no route yet), Trace, Ping
key down 4
key enter
wait 6000
expect request ok
shot ping-companion
